      "important_limitations": [
        "OTTS field 50 is engine make/type, not a confirmed VAG factory engine code.",
        "OTTS fields 14-18 identify make, commercial name, type, base vehicle/chassis and modifications; they do not establish exact engine/gearbox fitment by themselves.",
        "OTTS field 40 contains VINs covered by the approval; field 79 describes VIN structure.",
        "SBKTS Appendix 1 field 68 is gearbox make/type, but SBKTS is an individual-vehicle safety certificate, not an OTTS type-approval record.",
        "Do not use SBKTS personal data or package certificate PDFs without separate rights and privacy review.",
        "The EAEU OTTS form includes gearbox make/type and gear ratios in its technical annex, but this is not a guaranteed VAG factory gearbox code and does not establish exact individual-vehicle fitment.",
        "The EAEU OTTS form can include an ECU marking; treat it as a type-approval marking candidate, not proof of exact ECU hardware/software installed in each vehicle."
